Third-Party Scan Insertion for Wrapped Cores
You can use a third-party scan insertion tool to insert scan and perform scan stitching for 
wrapped cores in your design. The actual process depends on the third-party scan insertion tool 
you use. You must wrap all the inputs and outputs of hierarchical physical blocks and perform 
scan insertion and stitching in your design. Your choice of wrapper cells depends on the 
capabilities of the third-party scan tool you are using.

